<title>USA: Amoco says will complete Maxus venture July.</title>
<headline>Amoco says will complete Maxus venture July.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amoco Corp said on Monday that it would complete the formation of its natural gas joint venture with Maxus Energy, a unit of Argentina's YPF, in July of this year, the company's head of worldwide exploration and production Richard Flurry told a teleconference.</p>
<p>The Maxus venture covers natural gas in south Texas. ((-- David Chance New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
